     1411   PROCEDURE no-benq-i-office.
     1412   DEFINE OUTPUT PARAMETER found as logical init no.
     1413   define buffer buf_sale-doc for ub.sale-doc.
     1414   CASE X-Radio-Task > 1:
     1415     WHEN YES then do:
