     1461   on error undo, return error
     1462   :
     1463     assign
     1464     Sheetf.ColFOrmat = '5=@;15=@;16=dd/mm/yyyy'
     1465     .
     1466     run day-begin-fact-order in this-procedure(
     1467                                                 input  01/01/1990
     1468                                                ,output v-ini-fact-order
     1469                                               ) .
     1470     run waitfram-show in this-procedure ("Ждите...").
     1471     assign
